<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">01062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Kuwait's air defences intercepted missiles and drones early Monday, and US Central Command says it struck Iranian radar and command sites over the weekend.</s> <s>The war that began with strikes on Iran has widened to a Gulf monarchy that hosts American forces and tried hard to stay out of it.</s> <s>Whether the rest of the Gulf can avoid being pulled in may depend on what Tehran chooses next.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Ethiopia goes to the polls with more than fifty million voters registered, but the northern Tigray region is barred from voting entirely.</s> <s>The electoral board cited unfavourable conditions after the civil war of twenty twenty to twenty twenty-two — the same war Abiy Ahmed's Prosperity Party fought and won.</s> <s>It's a landslide built by deciding who may vote, not how they vote, with results expected by <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">11062026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China sent its Coast Guard to patrol waters east of Taiwan, the Pacific side rather than the strait, as Japan and the Philippines opened talks on their maritime boundary.</s> <s>Beijing called those talks a sovereignty infringement and answered with grey-zone vessels rather than warships — presence without open confrontation.</s> <s>The Coast Guard says it'll keep monitoring, leaving the region to wonder how far the patrols extend.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Lebanon's health ministry says Israeli airstrikes killed forty-one people and wounded a hundred and forty in a single day across the south, with heavy bombardment of Tyre.</s> <s>The cumulative toll has now passed three thousand four hundred since a ceasefire nominally took effect on <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">17042026</say-as>.</s> <s>It's a truce that exists on paper while the strikes and the body count go on.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A gelignite blast killed forty-six people, six of them children, in Myanmar's Shan State near the Chinese border.</s> <s>Ta'ang rebels had stored the quarrying explosive in a building barely three kilometres from China, and the cause is still under investigation.</s> <s>Rescue teams are still searching the rubble, and local media put the toll as high as fifty-five.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>American forces have killed two hundred and two people in more than sixty strikes on boats in South American waters, with no charges filed and no trials held.</s> <s>Operation Southern Spear has hit vessels since November on suspicion of drug trafficking, and Southern Command confirmed the latest strike on <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">30052026</say-as>.</s> <s>Congress has held no public hearing into who the dead were, or by what authority they were killed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Colombians voted in a first round that splits three ways, with Iván Cepeda and a hard-right rival tied near forty-three percent each.</s> <s>The choice is the country's geopolitical axis — continue Petro's autonomous path, or return to Washington's orbit with coca fumigation and militarised security.</s> <s>A runoff on <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">21062026</say-as> now looks near-certain, against a backdrop of more than five hundred acts of political violence this year.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Pakistan became the largest buyer of US cotton for a second straight week, taking sixty-eight thousand bales even as its own farmers' prices collapsed.</s> <s>The paradox has a cause: high energy tariffs and taxes make local cotton uncompetitive, so a textile-export economy imports the very fibre it grows.</s> <s>Five hundred ginning factories have shut or cut output, and industry bodies are warning of widespread bankruptcies.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's Aliko Dangote topped Africa's brand survey for an eighth consecutive year, his empire spanning cement, fertiliser, and the continent's largest oil refinery.</s> <s>Indigenous African brands still hold only fifteen percent of the continent's top hundred, the rest dominated by foreign names.</s> <s>Brand Africa's founder calls building homegrown brands the continent's most urgent economic task.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A payment block that pushed Coinbase out of India in twenty twenty-two ended Monday, with the exchange launching direct rupee bank transfers.</s> <s>Chainalysis ranks India first in the world for crypto adoption, and direct on-ramps decide who can actually move money in and out — the real moat.</s> <s>Whether the regulatory weather has truly shifted or merely paused, the next billion users are the prize.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Researchers at Kazakhstan's Nazarbayev University built biodegradable seed coatings from natural polymers that match synthetic hydrogels without leaving microplastics behind.</s> <s>The coatings hold moisture around a seed during germination in dry soil, then break down completely, unlike conventional treatments that persist for years in arid ground.</s> <s>It's Central Asian science answering a Central Asian problem, rather than importing a Western fix.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Five patients have recovered from the Bundibugyo strain of Ebola in the Democratic Republic of Congo, a strain that has no approved vaccine.</s> <s>The country's seventeenth outbreak reached a thousand suspected cases faster than any before it, <sub alias="Doctors Without Borders">MSF</sub> said.</s> <s>Uganda, which shares hundreds of kilometres of border, is watching a virus that still kills without a cure.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Italy's Space Agency sent a naval crew to sea for a hundred and seven days to mimic the isolation of a mission to Mars.</s> <s>Confinement, disrupted sleep, and the strain of team dynamics aboard the ICE-Blue voyage mirror what a Mars-class flight would demand of its astronauts.</s> <s>Samples will be compared with those from astronauts who flew to the space station, in sha'Allah sharpening what we know about the human limits of deep space.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Engineers in London built a depth-aware artificial intelligence that can locate a bronchoscope inside the branching airways of the lung without external tracking.</s> <s>Standard image tracking drifts because it lacks depth, so the system learns depth on its own, cutting positioning error by more than a third in tests.</s> <s>Whether it holds up inside a living patient is the next question, with human trial data still to come.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Civil society in Ecuador is warning that the state's appetite for AI surveillance will outpace any law meant to govern it.</s> <s>Ministries, regulators, and universities are each moving on separate timelines, with no authority to coordinate them.</s> <s>A forum gathered sixty stakeholders, but whether it yields binding rules or just more talk remains unresolved.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>